{"_id":"697d3e3f19b7a824528a4676","nodeId":"OLdWSGSwYnggN14BdH9nN","roadmapSlug":"ruby-on-rails","createdAt":"2026-01-30T23:26:55.240Z","description":"# Factory Bot\n\nFactory Bot is a library for creating Ruby objects for testing purposes. It provides a simple and clean syntax for defining factories, which are blueprints for creating instances of your models with pre-defined attributes. This helps to avoid repetitive setup code in your tests and ensures consistent test data.","resources":[{"type":"opensource","title":"factory_bot_rails","url":"https://github.com/thoughtbot/factory_bot_rails","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a275"},{"type":"article","title":"FactoryBot for Rails testing","url":"https://www.honeybadger.io/blog/factorybot-for-rails-testing-md/","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a276"},{"type":"article","title":"How I set up Factory Bot on a fresh Rails project","url":"http://codewithjason.com/set-factory-bot-fresh-rails-project/","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a277"},{"type":"article","title":"My Introduction To Factory Bot","url":"https://medium.com/@mariacristina.simoes/my-introduction-to-factory-bot-88949467a7e9","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a278"},{"type":"video","title":"Install Factory Bot with Ruby on Rails","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vQQKIyAHPI4","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a279"},{"type":"video","title":"Factory Bot Testing with Active Storage and Devise | Ruby on Rails 7 Tutorial","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7JdyQEcZ7F8","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a27a"},{"type":"video","title":"Factory Bot Tutorial for Beginners","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ef82mR9Mm8Q","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a27b"}],"updatedAt":"2026-01-30T23:26:55.240Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/ruby-on-rails/content/OLdWSGSwYnggN14BdH9nN.md"}